/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# local env files
.env*.local

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# private sibling folders (not part of the landing page)
/Poppin social inc./
/other/

# editor / agent settings. Project skills in .claude/skills are shared, so they stay in.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
.env*

# Raw brand animation sources. The GIFs and MP4s the ghost bits are authored
# as run 4-10MB each; public/ is served verbatim, so a copy left in there
# ships forty megabytes to every visitor. The shipping forms are the webp +
# still pairs in public/v2, produced from these. Originals live in the
# team's own Design folder, not in this repo.
public/v2/brand/

# Image and video masters. They are the input to public/v2/*, not the output,
# and a 6MB render has no business in git history.
assets-src/

# THE LIST ITSELF NEVER ENTERS GIT. 28,689 real addresses, exported from
# Loops, held on disk only for as long as a send takes. A repository is the
# wrong place for it: it is copied, cloned and kept forever by design.
waitlist-export.txt
*-export.txt
failed-*.txt
scheduled-*.json

# Resend disa aktarimlari: icinde gercek adresler var, depoya girmemeli.
*-sent.csv
resend-*.csv

# the template is meant to be committed
!.env.example
